<title>USA: U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boxed beef steady to firm on light demand and light to moderate offerings.  Select and Choice cuts generally steady with some firmness on some particular cuts in demand.  Beef trimmings lower on light to moderate demand and offerings. - USDA</p>
<p>------</p>
<p>211 Fab Lds  CH 1-3	CH 1-3	SE 1-3	SE 1-3</p>
